# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
#
# NOT-8, the regression net for #230: while the log is up, nothing
# reaches the program. Six keys the adventuring screen would answer -
# search, cast, look, and three the party walks by - and the screen does
# not move.
# A single leg and not a shortcut: the seam-off run has no log to swallow
# those keys, so it searches, casts and walks, the two runs end in
# different game states, and a diff between them means nothing
# (docs/journal-test-plan.md §3).

about nothing reaches the program while the log is up
kind single
program START.EXE
store tests/visual/reader-store.txt
both code-wheel

# No document, and no gate: since #290 the possession proof is the act,
# so what a leg says is a condition rather than a digest, and the run is
# made on the boot the challenge never stops (#291, #293).
code-wheel-answered
seam journal
until 272156800
every 25

key L@7551
key A@7801

# The log, then the barrage.
key N@9200
key S@9500
key C@9700
key L@9900
key Left@10100
key Right@10300
key Up@10500
key E@10800

# From the log settling to the last of the barrage, one frame.
same 9500-10700
